# Keep Docker build contexts small and free of host-only / generated artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# env & secrets (images get config via env vars at runtime, never baked in)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# generated Prisma clients & pothos types (regenerated during the build)
**/src/generated
**/prisma/generated

# local database data
**/.pgdata

# vcs / editor / OS noise
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# docs & charts are not needed inside application images
charts
*.md
!README.md
